This is **GATE PROGRESS**: Batch A is now closed.

It is not IRIS admission, continuity activation, Pilot PASS, production readiness or BIG Activation.

## NEXT LANE B — Whole-stack repair

`OWNER_B = BIG-OFFICE-DEVELOPMENT / CDA-owned authorized Builder substrate`

Release only **B1** now:

### B1 — Shared Semantic Kernel

Implement the smallest shared kernel required by the frozen constitution:
- A1 epistemic/domain algebra;
- A2 explicit identities/relations/causal occurrence primitives;
- A4 lifecycle/effect reducers needed as shared primitives;
- temporal/as-of primitives;
- semantic validators and explicit representation maps.

B1 must not:
- repair downstream callers independently;
- implement B2–B6 early;
- mutate replacement E1;
- invent new policy;
- deploy/merge to production;
- turn continuity ON;
- expand authority.

Required B1 return:
- exact branch/base/head/tree;
- changed surfaces;
- semantic-kernel mapping to Batch-A contracts;
- type/schema representation plan for B2;
- focused conformance evidence;
- full regression evidence;
- residual blockers;
- `STRATA_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED`.

After B1 acceptance, proceed dependency-order B2 -> B3 -> B4 -> B5 -> B6.

## NEXT LANE C — Independent oracle derivation

`OWNER_C = PROFESSOR / STRATA-ORCHESTRATED FRESH INDEPENDENT ORACLE AUTHOR`

Batch C may proceed in parallel with B1 because Batch-A semantics are frozen.

The oracle author must:
- consume Batch-A package + permitted source evidence;
- remain blind to repaired candidate outputs;
- not use historical contradictory test expectations as ground truth;
- freeze A1–A5 truth tables/state machines/mutation matrices and cross-cutting oracle requirements;
- include whole-stack counterexamples;
- produce the legacy-proof disposition execution;
- return a frozen independent oracle/proof package before it is used to score implementation.

Implementation != oracle derivation != independent acceptance.

## Preserved objects / prohibitions

Preserve:
- sealed audit;
- historical falsified candidate lineage;
- frozen replacement E1;
- narrow historical PASS evidence in exact scope;
- first-two-office Stage-B CLOSED state;
